# 📦 Deep-Research Inventory Management Integration Plan

Provide a deep, non-disruptive, end-to-end **Raw Ingredient & Recipe Inventory System** that seamlessly connects with **Menu Items, Categories, Cuisines, Orders, Dashboard KPIs, Reports, and Customer Checkout**.

---

## 🎯 Goal Overview

This plan details how Inventory Management integrates with **every existing page and form** in the project. It defines the exact database fields required, form-by-form UI additions, recipe-to-menu mapping logic, fulfillment stock auto-deduction, and real-time out-of-stock guards—all engineered to plug in **without breaking any existing project code**.

---

