### Component 3: Order Processing & Auto-Deduction Engine

#### [MODIFY] [ManageOrders.aspx.vb](file:///d:/Cloud%20Kitchen/CLoud%20Kitchen%20Project/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Cloud%20Kitchen/Admin/ManageOrders.aspx.vb)

In `btnUpdate_Click` (when admin updates status to `'Completed'`):

```vb
' Execute helper to deduct ingredients
DeductInventoryForOrder(orderId)
```

**`DeductInventoryForOrder(orderId)` Helper Workflow**:
1. Select items (`m_id`, `quantity`) from `Order_Details` for `orderId`.
2. For each item:
   - Deduct `m_unit_stock` if direct unit item.
   - For recipe items: Loop through `Dish_Ingredients` and execute:
     ```sql
     UPDATE Ingredients 
     SET stock_quantity = CASE WHEN stock_quantity - @DeductQty < 0 THEN 0 ELSE stock_quantity - @DeductQty END,
         last_updated = GETDATE()
     WHERE ingredient_id = @IngredientId
     ```
3. Run **Auto-Availability Safeguard**:
   For any affected dish `m_id`, check if any mapped ingredient has `stock_quantity <= 0`. If true:
   ```sql
   UPDATE menu_item SET m_availability = 'No' WHERE m_id = @AffectedDishId
   ```

